docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/weight-loss-surgery-perth.md:249:> Surgery is not the only pathway forward. Because obesity is a medical condition — not a willpower failure — the right treatment looks different for every person. Options range from GLP-1 medications and structured very low calorie diets, to dietitian-led nutrition support, exercise guidance, endoscopic procedures, and surgery.
