docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/am-i-eligible.md:295:  > Draft L266-L273: **5. What actually happens at the first appointment?** Your initial consultation runs for 30-60 minutes and is a relaxed, honest conversation about your weight history, health, and goals. Your surgeon explains which options are likely to suit you, walks through the relevant procedures, and discusses costs openly. You are welcome to ask as many questions as you like; there is zero obligation to proceed, and no pressure to decide anything on the day.
