docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/gastric-bypass-perth.md:13:> Medicare rebates may apply when MBS criteria are met. For Roux-en-Y gastric bypass, the relevant MBS item is 31572; your surgeon will confirm the appropriate Medicare item number, rebate eligibility and any private health fund requirements before surgery. Private health insurance with appropriate hospital cover may contribute to hospital and theatre costs, but out-of-pocket costs vary by fund and policy.
docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/gastric-bypass-perth.md:15:Why it matters: Item 31572 is the Roux-en-Y gastric bypass item, while 31581 is for biliopancreatic diversion with or without duodenal switch, so listing both as if they apply to this page is a compliance risk.
