docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/gastric-bypass-perth.md:356:> **What is the 30/30 rule after gastric bypass?** The 30/30 rule is an eating habit often recommended after bariatric surgery: take around 30 minutes to eat each meal, and avoid drinking fluids for 30 minutes either side of eating. Your dietitian will confirm the exact protocol the practice recommends for you. [30/30 protocol to be confirmed with the practice before publication]
