   132	- AHPRA/TGA: no testimonials, no before/after claims, no guaranteed outcomes; keep quantified outcome claims out of paste-ready copy. If a statistic is strategically wanted, add "verify: requires a cited clinical source + practice sign-off before publication" and do not publish it until verified
