   465	
   466	> The sleeve is generally a simpler operation and does not reroute the small intestine, but reflux and metabolic effects vary by patient. Read the [gastric sleeve Perth guide](/gastric-sleeve-perth) and discuss the differences, risks and nutritional requirements with your surgeon.
   467	
   468	Why it matters: Oversimplifying the sibling procedure can create accuracy issues and cannibalise the sleeve page.
