   226	> Neither procedure is universally better. Gastric bypass may be discussed for some patients with type 2 diabetes or reflux, but it is more complex and requires lifelong nutritional follow-up; a gastric sleeve may be appropriate for others. Read our [gastric sleeve Perth guide](/gastric-sleeve-perth) and [bariatric surgery Perth overview](/bariatric-surgery-perth), then discuss suitability, risks and expected outcomes with your surgeon.
